  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - Infrastructure Financing Event Series Technical Symposium, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting the Infrastructure Financing Workshop Series consisting of three workshops. The Event Series will promote cooperation between the public and private sectors in the United States and sub-Saharan Africa to enhance the enabling environment and catalyze investments for priority infrastructure projects in sub-Saharan Africa. This will further the likelihood of successful infrastructure projects across sub-Saharan Africa which are implemented utilizing U.S. goods and services.</narrative>
  </description>
